@@ -5,6 +5,19 @@ records the breaking changes that landed in that cut, newest first. Clean breaks
 — no legacy aliases, no back-compat shims (L invariant 4); every break is a one-line
 rename or import re-point per call site.
 
+## UNRELEASED — the yielding field (D3-F prototype)
+
+- `GlassDock`'s `backgroundCanvas` prop is deleted. Delete the binding
+  (`:background-canvas="…"`). `backdropMode: "live"` now means the plate is translucent and
+  a library substrate beneath yields under it; nothing is sampled.
+- `--glass-backdrop-luma` and `--glass-backdrop-luma-knee` are deleted. A consumer that wrote
+  either deletes the write.
+- `--glass-veil-ink` is renamed `--glass-veil-pole`. Light resolves `var(--card)`; dark is
+  `oklch(0.45 0.03 60)` at base 0.24.
+- New tokens per theme: `--field-well-pole`, `-gain`, `-feather`, `-outset`, `-ambient`.
+  New attribute: `data-field-well` registers a non-ladder element with the field.
+- `data-glass-field-canvas` is no longer read by anything; delete the stamp.
+
